% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary documents the failure, the quarantined v2.3.0 attempt, the rollback to v2.2.9, and follow-ups.\n\n**Things to flag for the on-call engineer**\n- The service is now two releases behind, and v2.3.0 can't be used as a stepping stone, so a fixed forward release will be needed.\n- Worth confirming v2.2.9 isn't also exposed to CVE-2026-4417 \u2014 the quarantine was only enforced on v2.3.0, but I couldn't verify the CVE's scope from the tools available.", "type": "text"}]}]}